==============================================================================
 RESTAURANT RUSH - you are the manager
==============================================================================
 18 turns, 2 tables. Win: >= 4 paid customers, revenue >= $45.00, average satisfaction >= 60.
 Each turn you give the Host, Waiter and Chef one task each (or 'wait'). Commands:
   seat <n>   Host or Waiter: seat queued customer n at a free table (both may seat, different customers)
   order <n>  Waiter: take seated customer n's order
   serve <n>  Waiter: serve customer n's READY order
   cook <n>   Chef: advance customer n's order by one preparation unit
   wait       do nothing with this staff member (an empty line works too)
   hh         (at the Happy Hour prompt) switch on Happy Hour, once per game: 2 turns, 20% off new orders,
              waiting customers recover 15 satisfaction at the start of each of those turns
   help, quit

